            "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import fsolve\n\n# Define the equation\ndef equation(x):\n    return np.sin(x) + x**2 - 42\n\n# Initial guesses to find different solutions\nguesses = [6, -6]\n\n# Use fsolve to find the roots\nsolutions = [fsolve(equation, guess)[0] for guess in guesses]\nsolutions",
